{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260mtjdq5yYr1795077242.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有外國記者指，因採訪APEC會議首次來到深圳，體驗到深圳這個城市的魅力及科技的迅速發展。</p><p></p><p>委內瑞拉記者Rodney Ezequiel說：「這是我第一次來到深圳，非常驚人，這邊的人都很令人驚嘆，這城市一切都很美麗、令人敬畏，這裡的科技讓人印象深刻，因為我的國家沒有。」</p><p></p><p>墨西哥記者Carlos Ruiz稱：「這是我首次來中國，首次有機會來深圳，非常震撼、我們被中國迷倒，包括科技、本地的款待，這裡的人非常友善，幫了我們很多。」</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:35:02.752867+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T23:57:33.738851+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:28:25.410511+00:00","content_hash":"13fe68eb1c9abf4352cbd0e867e7671458174e84be5afe5c60857c43be457cd0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:35:02.752867+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}